 {"box": [119, 104, 307, 364], "ink": "light", "text": "The name of a devil from ancient myth, said to serve Beal, the devil who rules fire. It became famous through \"The Forest of Thorns,\" a short work by Razuel, a playwright of a century ago, in which it appears as guardian devil of the \"Gate of Origin.\"\n\nThe Slave Demons in the ruins, as in the ancient myths, control fire at will. But drench one with water and it can no longer control its flames.", "size": 14}
